# Two Federation destroyers on layouts/damage.jsonc: Low starts with a tenth of its crew, Full with all of it. The dump
# names the damage nodes each model shows (Low shows its crew nodes, Full none); the shots show the fire on the model.
# Run it with --layout layouts/damage.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
scroll up 20
wait 1
shot close
dump d1
wait 2
shot close2
dump d2
